        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Estimate a quantity",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "大概 gives an estimate. Adjacent small numerals can give an approximate range; they are not an exact combined number.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "大概有十个人。",
                "pinyin": "dàgài yǒu shí gè rén 。",
                "meaning": "There are about ten people.",
                "audio": "beb9785df13538c5e7123c7ea59f7a372002521e11a784ba43087233517d0da4"
              },
              {
                "text": "我有两三本书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yǒu liǎng sān běn shū 。",
